The example data under examples/ are redistributed under their own licences,
which travel with them:

  examples/openff/     Open Force Field protein-ligand-benchmark, MIT
                       (examples/openff/LICENSE_openff_protein-ligand-benchmark.txt)
  examples/schindler/  Merck KGaA FEP benchmark, MIT
                       (examples/schindler/LICENSE_MCompChem_fep-benchmark.txt)
  examples/ross/       Schrodinger public binding free energy benchmark, MIT
                       (examples/ross/LICENSE_schrodinger_benchmark.txt)
  examples/pockets/    binding sites trimmed from wwPDB entries, public domain (CC0)
  examples/sutherland/ structures from the supplementary material of
                       Sutherland, O'Brien & Weaver, J. Med. Chem. 47 (2004) 5541
  examples/mittal/     structures from the supplementary material of the cited publications
